on\",\n            \"explanation\": \"Calha de Cabeamento, a robust and high-capacity closed conduit similar to a raceway, is presented as a solution for cable routing and protection [Data: Entities (858)]. Its use cases include installations requiring a closed and robust conduit [Data: Relationships (1339)], particularly in applications like raised floors [Data: Relationships (1338)]. This type of infrastructure is important for cable accommodation [Data: Relationships (1329)] and is suitable for areas demanding secure cable management.\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"summary\": \"Applicability to specific installation environments\",\n            \"explanation\": \"While ANSI/TIA 569 is designed for commercial and enterprise environments, its principles can be applied or adapted to other settings. Installations requiring a closed and robust conduit may benefit from considerations of cable density and the separation of electrical and data cables [Data: Relationships (1346, 1347)]. The standard's focus on standardized infrastructure is particularly valuable for large-scale IT deployments.\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"rating\": 7.0,\n    \"rating_explanation\": \"The impact severity rating is high due to the foundational nature of ANSI/TIA 569 in ensuring reliable and safe telecommunications infrastructure in commercial environments, with potential for significant disruption if standards are not met.\"\n}", "refusal": null, "role": "assistant", "annotations": null, "audio": null, "function_call": null, "tool_calls": null, "provider_specific_fields": {"refusal": null, "reasoning": null}}, "provider_specific_fields": {"native_finish_reason": "STOP"}}], "created": 1788041320, "model": "google/gemini-2.5-flash-lite", "object": "chat.completion", "moderation": null, "service_tier": "default", "system_fingerprint": null, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 1063, "prompt_tokens": 3837, "total_tokens": 4900, "completion_tokens_details": {"accepted_prediction_tokens": null,